OL,3,AHuawei found guilty of stealing US     
OL,4,Atrade secrets but acquitted of         
OL,5,Aracketeering                           
OL,7,FHuawei's defence team argued that      
OL,8,Fprosecutors had decided Huawei was a   
OL,9,Fcriminal organisation and built its    
OL,10,Fcase from there, but the firm's success
OL,11,Fwas due to its own innovation.         
OL,13,FHuawei said the racketeering acquittal 
OL,14,F"confirms that these allegations lack  
OL,15,Ffactual basis", adding that it would   
OL,16,F"take all necessary legal actions to   
OL,17,Fdefend our rights and interests".      
